You know what I feel like now?

785
01:13:32.282 --> 01:13:34.282
Hungry.

786
01:13:37.087 --> 01:13:39.087
Safe.

787
01:13:46.463 --> 01:13:48.878
It's going to end up like the...

788
01:13:48.883 --> 01:13:51.298
movies, this
happily ever after?

789
01:13:54.971 --> 01:13:57.599
By tonight, this is all
gonna be a fading memory.

790
01:13:58.074 --> 01:14:02.067
It's gonna be you and me,
laughing over chicken Kiev.

791
01:14:04.347 --> 01:14:06.347
Liar.

792
01:14:23.833 --> 01:14:25.926
Mr. Minister, an
update, please.

793
01:14:27.637 --> 01:14:30.068
I am ready to sign
the contract...

794
01:14:30.073 --> 01:14:32.074
once I speak to my daughter.

795
01:14:33.910 --> 01:14:36.777
Hello? Hello?

796
01:14:37.347 --> 01:14:39.975
Have that pen ready.
I'll call you back.

797
01:14:48.625 --> 01:14:50.786
We are closing
the noose, Frank.

798
01:14:51.394 --> 01:14:53.165
Well, when it closes,
make sure no...

799
01:14:53.170 --> 01:14:54.926
one tries to drag
me out of the car.

800
01:14:54.931 --> 01:14:56.931
You know what
this is about yet?

801
01:14:57.700 --> 01:15:00.191
The girl. Her father.

802
01:15:00.537 --> 01:15:03.062
Large amounts of toxic waste.

803
01:15:03.273 --> 01:15:05.605
It is a trade. His
signature for her life.

804
01:15:07.343 --> 01:15:10.403
I have a reputation to
uphold here, inspector.

805
01:15:10.613 --> 01:15:13.844
One hundred percent
successful delivery rate.

806
01:15:14.050 --> 01:15:17.508
Am I detecting a
little attachment?

807
01:15:18.021 --> 01:15:20.725
That is not the
Frank I know. With...

808
01:15:20.730 --> 01:15:23.288
his rules, no names,
no attachment.

809
01:15:23.493 --> 01:15:25.688
Why is everyone so
concerned about my rules?

810
01:15:26.396 --> 01:15:31.993
Frank, I always suspected
you are a romantic at heart.

811
01:15:33.970 --> 01:15:35.970
Anything else?

812
01:15:36.172 --> 01:15:38.036
Where is the rendezvous?

813
01:15:38.041 --> 01:15:40.041
I'll call you back.

814
01:15:44.714 --> 01:15:45.714
- Yeah.

815
01:15:45.719 --> 01:15:47.545
We're almost at
the end, Frank.

816
01:15:47.550 --> 01:15:49.158
- Just give me
the coordinates.

817
01:15:49.163 --> 01:15:50.815
No more coordinates.

818
01:15:50.820 --> 01:15:52.820
The road you're on.

819
01:15:53.156 --> 01:15:55.156
Make your first left.

820
01:15:55.291 --> 01:15:57.291
I'd like to know
where I'm going.

821
01:16:01.564 --> 01:16:04.032
You'll know when
you get there.

822
01:16:34.063 --> 01:16:36.513
Don't worry. We got them
right where we want them.

823
01:16:43.273 --> 01:16:45.273
My compliments, Frank.

824
01:16:45.441 --> 01:16:49.070
Our trust in your
abilities was well deserved.

825
01:16:49.646 --> 01:16:51.646
If you could please
send the girl out.

826
01:16:53.116 --> 01:16:54.979
She's coming.

827
01:16:54.984 --> 01:16:57.077
I'm not coming.

828
01:16:57.787 --> 01:16:59.914
They need you.
They won't kill you.

829
01:17:00.123 --> 01:17:02.455
But they will kill you.

830
01:17:02.959 --> 01:17:04.874
Do I look like a man
who came halfway...

831
01:17:04.879 --> 01:17:06.879
across Europe to
die on a bridge?

832
01:17:08.464 --> 01:17:10.464
Do I?

833
01:17:18.741 --> 01:17:21.209
We don't have all day, Frank.

834
01:17:25.048 --> 01:17:26.811
Look how many of them.

835
01:17:26.816 --> 01:17:28.816
They have all the guns.

836
01:17:28.952 --> 01:17:30.952
How it's gonna be okay?

837
01:17:34.290 --> 01:17:36.290
Tell you over dinner.

838
01:17:37.260 --> 01:17:39.260
Now, go.

839
01:17:39.429 --> 01:17:40.858
Go.

840
01:17:40.863 --> 01:17:42.863
Kiss me.

841
01:17:59.482 --> 01:18:01.482
Go.

842
01:18:05.855 --> 01:18:08.415
You're gonna get
me killed. Now, go.

843
01:18:33.116 --> 01:18:35.311
Get to her, you bastard.

844
01:19:00.677 --> 01:19:02.736
Better now, darling?

845
01:19:21.197 --> 01:19:23.197
Finish him.

846
01:19:42.218 --> 01:19:44.516
No. Frank.

847
01:19:55.797 --> 01:19:58.288
His beloved car
will be his grave.

848
01:19:58.500 --> 01:20:01.500
Leaves it, he blows. Stays, he
drowns. Let's get out of here.

849
01:20:12.614 --> 01:20:14.614
- Tarconi.
- They have the girl.

850
01:20:15.884 --> 01:20:19.320
Frank, we are trying to track
him through the phone signal.

851
01:20:19.521 --> 01:20:21.751
- Where are you?
- In a lake.

852
01:20:22.991 --> 01:20:24.991
A lake?

853
01:20:25.127 --> 01:20:27.127
Can you be more specific?

854
01:20:27.195 --> 01:20:29.195
There's a dam.

855
01:20:30.132 --> 01:20:32.132
- A dam?
- I know the place, sir.

856
01:20:32.267 --> 01:20:34.267
- How far?
- Ten minutes at least.

857
01:20:34.302 --> 01:20:36.302
Frank, we'll be
there in 10 minutes.

858
01:20:36.338 --> 01:20:38.101
Can you make it any faster?

859
01:20:38.106 --> 01:20:40.404
- We'll do our best.
- Thank you.

860
01:22:38.860 --> 01:22:40.860
Buy tickets for all of us.

861
01:22:40.962 --> 01:22:42.559
Where to?

862
01:22:42.564 --> 01:22:44.475
Anywhere this train
is going. We...

863
01:22:44.480 --> 01:22:46.500
need to keep moving
for half an hour.

864
01:22:46.701 --> 01:22:48.701
Why don't we just
keep driving around?

865
01:22:54.276 --> 01:22:56.276
Another day.

866
01:23:10.191 --> 01:23:12.682
Sir. There.

867
01:23:29.911 --> 01:23:34.041
- Out. Out.
- Everybody out.

868
01:23:34.282 --> 01:23:36.282
- Come on.
- Move.

869
01:23:36.451 --> 01:23:38.451
Move, quick.

870
01:23:55.971 --> 01:23:57.971
- Mr. Minister?
- Yes.

871
01:23:58.273 --> 01:24:00.273
Someone wants to talk to you.

872
01:24:01.309 --> 01:24:03.971
- Papa.
- Are you all right?

873
01:24:08.550 --> 01:24:10.550
Don't sign.

874
01:24:10.919 --> 01:24:13.979
What you have is 15 minutes.

875
01:24:21.262 --> 01:24:22.953
- You ever find out
what this is about?

876
01:24:22.958 --> 01:24:24.160
Garbage.

877
01:24:24.165 --> 01:24:26.165
How much garbage
are we talking?

878
01:24:26.634 --> 01:24:30.195
Enough to pollute half the
country for a hundred years.

879
01:24:30.405 --> 01:24:32.405
Try it again.

880
01:24:52.127 --> 01:24:55.460
For a modern woman,
you are very uninformed.

881
01:24:55.730 --> 01:24:57.730
This is the new world.

882
01:24:58.566 --> 01:25:00.830
There are no more
countries. That's old think.

883
01:25:01.269 --> 01:25:04.636
There are just economic
realities. Profit and loss.

884
01:25:04.839 --> 01:25:07.569
Efficiency and waste.

885
01:25:07.776 --> 01:25:09.776
Think global, not local.

886
01:25:10.578 --> 01:25:12.578
Think this.

887
01:25:27.328 --> 01:25:29.328
- Yes?
- Where are we?

888
01:25:36.905 --> 01:25:38.905
We're almost there.

889
01:25:41.042 --> 01:25:42.605
Where?

890
01:25:42.610 --> 01:25:44.635
Here. He is on a train.

891
01:25:45.280 --> 01:25:47.612
- And where are we?
- Here.

892
01:25:47.816 --> 01:25:50.011
We can get units there.

893
01:25:51.686 --> 01:25:53.686
That's a good idea. Do that.

894
01:25:57.459 --> 01:26:00.292
Oh, Frank, come on.

895
01:26:32.193 --> 01:26:34.753
Mr. Minister, I assure
you, everything is in order.

896
01:26:34.963 --> 01:26:36.963
I'm sure it is.

897
01:26:37.265 --> 01:26:41.099
- If there are any problems...
- I know you will solve them.

898
01:26:42.036 --> 01:26:44.036
Now, if you don't mind...

899
01:27:14.335 --> 01:27:15.974
You might not believe this,

900
01:27:15.979 --> 01:27:17.979
but I am, at
heart, a pacifist.

901
01:27:19.140 --> 01:27:21.199
I hate violence.

902
01:27:23.211 --> 01:27:26.009
It creates more
problems than it solves.

903
01:27:27.649 --> 01:27:30.482
You know, I never
wanted to do any of this.

904
01:27:31.986 --> 01:27:35.046
A client asked me
to obtain a result...

905
01:27:35.523 --> 01:27:37.723
...so I went about
creating an environment...

906
01:27:37.825 --> 01:27:39.789
...with the least
amount of bloodshed.

907
01:27:39.794 --> 01:27:41.133
No one wanted to cooperate.

908
01:27:41.138 --> 01:27:42.725
Not you, not the
first driver...

909
01:27:42.730 --> 01:27:44.580
...not your father, not the...

910
01:27:44.585 --> 01:27:46.585
recently deceased
Frank Martin.

911
01:27:47.635 --> 01:27:50.195
Everyone wanted to fight.

912
01:28:05.587 --> 01:28:07.587
What's so funny?

913
01:28:08.022 --> 01:28:10.513
Hearing a dead man talking.

914
01:30:23.391 --> 01:30:25.391
One more step, Frank.

915
01:30:25.760 --> 01:30:27.760
Come on. One more.

916
01:31:10.905 --> 01:31:12.702
Look.

917
01:31:12.707 --> 01:31:14.637
It's over.

918
01:31:14.642 --> 01:31:16.642
Two minutes to 9. He signed.

919
01:31:20.114 --> 01:31:22.207
Oh, my God.

920
01:31:27.488 --> 01:31:29.488
No, Frank. No, no.

921
01:32:09.930 --> 01:32:12.364
It's over, Frank. It's over.

922
01:32:13.633 --> 01:32:16.283
Mission accomplished. You
and the girl are free to go.

923
01:32:17.704 --> 01:32:20.154
Matter of fact, I'm so
impressed by your talent...

924
01:32:20.240 --> 01:32:22.103
...I'd like to
offer you a position.

925
01:32:22.108 --> 01:32:25.407
I'd like to offer you
one. Permanently disabled.

926
01:32:44.698 --> 01:32:46.228
I hate to waste talent.

927
01:32:46.233 --> 01:32:48.733
But I really don't think
we'd make a very good fit.

928
01:32:48.735 --> 01:32:50.735
That's right.

929
01:33:14.027 --> 01:33:16.027
No.

930
01:33:19.065 --> 01:33:20.736
We wouldn't fit,
but you and the...

931
01:33:20.741 --> 01:33:22.741
bracelet were made
for each other.

932
01:33:26.806 --> 01:33:28.806
No, no.

933
01:33:39.386 --> 01:33:41.386
No.

934
01:33:42.055 --> 01:33:44.055
No.

935
01:33:59.005 --> 01:34:01.005
You're doing the right thing.

936
01:34:20.727 --> 01:34:22.727
Valentina.

937
01:34:27.601 --> 01:34:29.601
Valentina.

938
01:34:39.145 --> 01:34:41.272
Am I in heaven?

939
01:34:44.417 --> 01:34:46.681
Looks more like we're in hell.

940
01:34:47.187 --> 01:34:49.187
I don't care.

941
01:34:49.322 --> 01:34:51.322
As long as we're
there together.

942
01:35:03.336 --> 01:35:04.599
Yes?

943
01:35:04.604 --> 01:35:07.767
Mr. Minister, your
daughter is in good hands.

944
01:35:09.275 --> 01:35:11.275
Thank you.

945
01:35:25.392 --> 01:35:26.438
- What are you doing?

946
01:35:26.443 --> 01:35:27.989
What you said,
the right thing.

947
01:35:27.994 --> 01:35:29.503
And now, if you'll excuse me,

948
01:35:29.508 --> 01:35:31.426
I have a conference
to address...

949
01:35:31.431 --> 01:35:34.366
...on the dangers of doing
business with people like you.

950
01:35:34.567 --> 01:35:36.567
Thank you very much.

951
01:35:54.754 --> 01:35:55.984
Is the launch ready?

952
01:35:55.989 --> 01:35:57.757
- It's on the water,
sir, waiting.

953
01:35:57.762 --> 01:35:59.054
Time to leave.

954
01:35:59.059 --> 01:36:01.059
- Grab the log.
- Okay.

955
01:36:19.512 --> 01:36:22.379
I just don't understand it.

956
01:36:22.582 --> 01:36:24.582
When I was a boy,
my father and I...

957
01:36:24.751 --> 01:36:28.084
...used to pull fish out of
this very spot all day long.

958
01:36:28.288 --> 01:36:30.288
Times change, inspector.

959
01:36:30.523 --> 01:36:32.523
As do people.

960
01:36:35.261 --> 01:36:37.261
You referring to me?

961
01:36:38.765 --> 01:36:41.065
I don't think that's a
very accurate statement.

962
01:36:41.801 --> 01:36:44.031
I drive the same car,
live in the same house.

963
01:36:44.237 --> 01:36:48.367
Oh, I was not referring
to your car or your house.

964
01:36:51.244 --> 01:36:53.610
The sea is so restful.

965
01:36:53.813 --> 01:36:55.813
Is lunch ready yet?

966
01:36:56.249 --> 01:36:59.548
Mademoiselle, there is a
certain progression to things.

967
01:36:59.753 --> 01:37:03.086
In order to eat the lunch, you
first have to catch the lunch.

968
01:37:03.289 --> 01:37:05.720
And if we keep talking
instead of concentrating...

969
01:37:05.725 --> 01:37:07.255
...we're gonna catch nothing.

970
01:37:07.260 --> 01:37:09.061
I have better idea. Why we...

971
01:37:09.066 --> 01:37:11.066
don't skip catching
of lunch...

972
01:37:11.197 --> 01:37:13.197
...and go right
to eating of lunch?

973
01:37:13.333 --> 01:37:16.496
I know wonderful place
just up coast from here...

974
01:37:16.703 --> 01:37:19.604
...where they make
fish stew. Incredible.

975
01:37:19.806 --> 01:37:22.903
They use tomatoes
and onions, and...

976
01:37:22.908 --> 01:37:25.574
little amount of
wild lavender.

977
01:37:26.279 --> 01:37:28.279
What kind of wine?

978
01:37:28.381 --> 01:37:30.381
Pink. From south.

979
01:37:31.417 --> 01:37:33.417
A Châteauneuf, perhaps.

980
01:37:33.720 --> 01:37:36.154
- Chilled.
- Of course, chilled.

981
01:37:36.356 --> 01:37:38.356
And for dessert?

982
01:39:43.241 --> 01:39:49.241
<font color=#38B0DE>Subtitles by ElDorado80</font>
